## HISTORY / GOTCHAS
- Manual encoder ISR was replaced by RotaryEncoder lib — don't revert
- Playback and SysInfo screens were deliberately removed from dev-work
- Display rotation: LovyanGFX rotation(1) = landscape; rotation(0) = portrait (different from Adafruit)
- offset_y=20 is critical, don't change without hardware testing
- .vscode is gitignored, don't track it
- Second encoder (pins 4/5/6) exists in hardware but has NO assigned behavior yet
